Description:

EmailSubmission/set now supplies an onSend for a scheduled submission when
the client's onSuccessUpdateEmail puts the email in the "scheduled" mailbox
without one: on send, the email moves to the "sent" mailbox and loses
$draft.  Before, a client that didn't know about the onSend extension left
its scheduled email in the "scheduled" mailbox forever.


